<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Blind</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Healer (guild level 8), Necromancer (guild level 9)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast blind &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>When a priest prays to their god to blind an enemy, the god may take it 
literally: the target is struck blind for a while, and can't see the room or 
who is in it. The better your spell, the longer it lasts, from a minute up to 
several minutes. Cure blind heals it.
</p><p>The target resists with their mind, and the spell may fail. Either way, 
casting it is an attack and starts a fight. Someone already blind can't be 
blinded more. You must be standing. It is also found on scrolls, potions, 
staffs and wands.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cure Blind</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>